WEBVTT

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Mr. Luther.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.949
You received another one, sir.

00:00:18.949 --> 00:00:23.820
Thank you.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:31.750
That's it for the night.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:04:27.600
I don't know.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.600
I came home and Clark was gone.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.600
He talked about going to the fortress.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.600
Last time he went to the fortress, Jarrell trapped him in ice for a month.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.600
Why would he chanced the big chill a second time?

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:40.600
We just found out that Kara moved in with Lex at the mansion.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.600
Clark was hoping that Jarrell will give her back her memories and her powers.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.600
Before Lex uncovers our secret.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:48.600
He wanted to get up there fast, but he needed something from the loft first.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:05:04.620
I don't think he got what he came in here for.

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.970
This key opens the portal to the fortress.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.970
How did you know that?

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:12.970
I kind of followed him there a couple of years ago.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:14.970
The key's still here.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:17.970
Then he never made it to the fortress, so something must have stopped him.

00:05:17.970 --> 00:07:19.870
I'll ramp it up 50%.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.870
You tried for three.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.870
I'm guessing 100% will kill you.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:08:10.259
Whoever would have guessed that skinny, little, Patty, Swan

00:08:10.259 --> 00:08:14.259
was the author of those alarmingly cryptic messages.

00:08:14.259 --> 00:08:15.259
It's Patricia.

00:08:15.259 --> 00:08:16.259
And it's nice.

00:08:16.259 --> 00:08:18.259
to see you too, Lionel.

00:08:18.259 --> 00:08:21.259
Last time I saw you, you and Lex were children swimming in our lake.

00:08:21.259 --> 00:08:25.259
And your father, Mergel Swan, he adored the great outdoors.

00:08:25.259 --> 00:08:29.259
Then he shut himself away inside that dank musty planetarium.

00:08:29.259 --> 00:08:34.259
We both know that those family get-togethethers weren't about the great outdoors.

00:08:34.259 --> 00:08:40.909
When dad died, I inherited his estate.

00:08:40.909 --> 00:08:44.909
After a long probate, I've recently received all of his research.

00:08:44.909 --> 00:08:47.909
He was obsessed with one subject in particular.

00:08:47.909 --> 00:08:48.909
A traveler for him.

00:08:48.909 --> 00:08:53.909
A traveler from another galaxy who came to Smallville in a meteor shower.

00:08:53.909 --> 00:08:56.909
A great scientist with a vivid imagination.

00:08:56.909 --> 00:08:59.909
My father wasn't the only one who believed in the traveler.

00:08:59.909 --> 00:09:02.909
Four powerful families would gather every summer.

00:09:02.909 --> 00:09:06.909
My dad, the Queens, the Teagues, and you,

00:09:06.909 --> 00:09:12.700
according to his journals, the group formed a secret society, Veritas.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.950
Veritas.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.950
Veritas, that's right, our astronomy club.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.950
You were preparing to welcome the traveler.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.950
The group planned on sharing the restaurant.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.950
responsibility of keeping him safe once he arrived.

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:31.379
But everyone died, except you.

00:09:31.379 --> 00:09:41.700
Where are you going with this?

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:47.700
You killed Edward Teague, and Robert and Laura Queen.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.700
And I am sure that you had a hand in my father's death.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:56.139
His brilliance was lost on you.

00:09:56.139 --> 00:10:00.659
Have proof!

00:10:00.659 --> 00:10:06.769
I found evidence my father collected and stored with his journals.

00:10:06.769 --> 00:10:09.769
You wanted the traveler all for yourself.

00:10:09.769 --> 00:10:10.769
For your own.

00:10:10.769 --> 00:10:18.769
own personal gain. Turn over the son of Krypton. Or I will release the evidence linking you to their murders.

00:10:18.769 --> 00:10:27.940
The traveler from another galaxy. A clandestine cabal. A series of murders.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:31.940
Ooh, that's quite a story. You'd be careful who you tell it to.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:37.940
Don't test me, Lionel. Take me to the traveler now.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:41.940
You haven't changed. You're still that black.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.940
bossy little girl you used to be.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:51.340
But this time, Patty, you're swimming way out of your depth.

00:10:51.340 --> 00:11:34.299
I hope you like your room.

00:11:34.299 --> 00:11:39.700
I only moved in last night and it already feels like home.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.700
Thank you for letting me stay here, Lex.

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.700
Take another look at your alleged biography?

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.700
Yeah, I thought I'd give it another try.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.700
I still don't feel like I was ever this person.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:57.049
Kara, you should really consider having the procedure we talked about.

00:11:57.049 --> 00:12:02.039
I don't know. I mean, I don't have my memory

00:12:02.059 --> 00:12:04.059
but I'm pretty sure I don't like hospitals.

00:12:04.059 --> 00:12:06.059
It would be done in my private clinic

00:12:06.059 --> 00:12:09.059
by a team of the world's top neurologists.

00:12:09.059 --> 00:12:14.100
You said you trusted me.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:17.100
Trust me now. Let me help you.

00:12:26.509 --> 00:12:27.509
I'll do it.

00:12:27.509 --> 00:12:36.460
I'll pull my team together as soon as possible.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:13:05.240
Night care.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.240
We've been watching her since she arrived, sir.

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:09.240
So far, nothing indicates she's anything more

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:11.240
than a pretty girl from Minnesota.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.240
I don't pay you to comment in her appearance.

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:19.929
Besides, looks can be deceiving.

00:13:19.929 --> 00:13:20.929
Kair has agreed to do the precise.

00:13:20.929 --> 00:13:24.929
Mr. Sir, if I may, we just started observing her.

00:13:24.929 --> 00:13:28.929
Her mind may contain answers to questions I've had for a very long time.

00:13:28.929 --> 00:13:30.929
Now I've waited long enough.

00:13:30.929 --> 00:13:33.929
How soon can the lab be ready?

00:13:33.929 --> 00:13:38.460
Tomorrow?

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.460
Keep an eye on her.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.460
She shows any sign her memory is coming back.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:44.460
Lock this place down.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:14:15.000
How are you doing?

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:19.000
I built that cell to contain him not for you to use as a torture chamber.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:22.759
Mr. Luther, you hired me because of my experience with him.

00:14:22.759 --> 00:14:24.759
because of my experience with these freaks.

00:14:24.759 --> 00:14:28.759
If anything happens to him, anything at all,

00:14:28.759 --> 00:14:30.759
because of your appetite for cruelty,

00:14:30.759 --> 00:14:32.759
you will be held responsible.

00:14:32.759 --> 00:15:00.779
No.

00:15:00.779 --> 00:15:04.409
Well, I don't agree with you.

00:15:04.409 --> 00:15:06.409
Absolutely not.

00:15:06.409 --> 00:15:08.409
Lina.

00:15:08.409 --> 00:15:10.409
I'll get back to you.

00:15:10.409 --> 00:15:12.409
Lama, Ms. Sullivan,

00:15:12.409 --> 00:15:14.409
I've got my people searching,

00:15:14.409 --> 00:15:16.409
discreetly, of course, the government agencies.

00:15:16.409 --> 00:15:19.409
If any of them are responsible for taking Clark, we'll know very soon.

00:15:19.409 --> 00:15:20.409
Maybe.

00:15:20.409 --> 00:15:26.669
you could help. Do you know what this is?

00:15:26.669 --> 00:15:32.669
I believe it's an electrode, probably from a taser gun.

00:15:32.669 --> 00:15:36.620
This is kryptonite.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.620
We found it in the barn after Clark was taken.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:42.620
As far as we know, everyone that knows about Clark's weaknesses in this room.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.620
It wasn't Chloe, and it wasn't me.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:50.820
I told you in Clark, she'd been spending time with Lex.

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:51.820
Now she's moved in with him.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:52.820
But her memory...

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:53.820
Might be coming back.

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.820
Little by little, wouldn't take much.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:57.820
Just a few simple words.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.820
Enough for...

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:00.820
to work out Clark's secret.

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:05.820
I'd hate to think that my son is responsible for any of this.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:09.549
This is Clark's worst fear.

00:16:09.549 --> 00:16:11.549
Alex Dynamics.

00:16:11.549 --> 00:16:15.549
Alex Dynamics has military contracts, developing combat technologies.

00:16:15.549 --> 00:16:20.549
I'll do some research, see if any of it involves electroshock or...

00:16:20.549 --> 00:16:26.909
If he harms Clark, I will kill him.

00:16:26.909 --> 00:16:29.909
I'll deal with him, Lana. He's my son.

00:16:29.909 --> 00:16:42.769
I want Clark back safely as much as you do.

00:16:42.769 --> 00:16:43.769
Chloe.

00:16:43.769 --> 00:16:46.009
I dug around for some information on LX Dynamics.

00:16:46.009 --> 00:16:47.029
Lionel was right.

00:16:47.029 --> 00:16:50.149
Lex is having them build experimental tasers for the military.

00:16:50.149 --> 00:16:51.769
Actually, I've been wielding my own shovel,

00:16:51.769 --> 00:16:54.389
and I think I may have found where clerk is being held.

00:16:54.389 --> 00:16:57.750
About a year and a half ago, Luther Corp bought an abandoned airstrip

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.250
just outside the city.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:01.230
Now, they rebuilt the hangar.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:03.429
Check out the construction manifest.

00:17:03.429 --> 00:17:08.670
Concrete reinforced plexiglass in a ton of refined meteor rock.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:10.789
Lex built another 33.1 lab.

00:17:10.789 --> 00:17:12.289
Wrong Luther.

00:17:12.289 --> 00:17:13.670
According to all of these records,

00:17:13.769 --> 00:17:14.769
This was all Lionel.

00:17:14.769 --> 00:17:19.400
Construction started around the same time

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.099
Lionel found out Clark's secret.

00:17:21.099 --> 00:17:24.099
The Department of Water and Power said they turned the lights on

00:17:24.099 --> 00:17:26.099
for the first time two days ago.

00:17:26.099 --> 00:17:29.099
Wadde's been planning this kidnapping for months.

00:17:29.099 --> 00:17:33.099
And if these specs are accurate, the place is built like Fort Knox.

00:17:33.099 --> 00:17:35.099
We need Kara.

00:17:35.099 --> 00:17:38.099
Chloe, Kara can't help if she doesn't have her powers back.

00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:41.099
Clark was on his way to the Fortress of Solitude to Astral for help.

00:17:41.099 --> 00:17:44.099
Now maybe we can pull or express Kara there ourselves.

00:17:44.099 --> 00:17:45.099
The key, do you know how to use it?

00:17:45.099 --> 00:17:46.099
to use it?

00:17:46.099 --> 00:17:48.099
If we can get her out of the mansion, I can get her there.

00:17:48.099 --> 00:17:49.099
She wanted to move in with Lex.

00:17:49.099 --> 00:17:51.099
I don't think it'll be easy getting her to leave.

00:17:51.099 --> 00:17:54.099
Lex probably quadrupled his security since she moved in.

00:17:54.099 --> 00:17:56.099
We won't be able to get past the mailbox.

00:17:56.099 --> 00:17:59.099
Thinking something a little more stealth.

00:17:59.099 --> 00:18:04.099
When I was married to Lexi, he showed me these escape passageways he had built in case of another home invasion.

00:18:04.099 --> 00:18:08.099
So use his secret way out to sneak in.

00:18:08.099 --> 00:18:17.630
It's good to see a friendly face from my childhood.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.630
What brings you to Smallville?

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.630
I'm rarely in Metropolis.

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:22.630
in Metropolis, but I have some business there,

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.630
and I remembered you'd moved out here.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.630
Well, I'm glad she came by, Patricia.

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.630
I have to admit.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.630
I don't recall much when we were kids.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.630
After getting caught in that meteor shower,

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:36.630
the years leading up to it, became something of a fog.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.630
You were so young, Lex.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:40.630
It must have been traumatizing.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.630
I survived.

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:45.619
What about you?

00:18:45.619 --> 00:18:47.619
Where did you disappear to?

00:18:47.619 --> 00:18:51.619
I spent most of my life studying abroad

00:18:51.619 --> 00:18:52.619
when Dad did you.

00:18:52.619 --> 00:18:54.619
I decided to stay in Europe.

00:18:54.619 --> 00:18:57.619
I always admired Dr. Swan's genius.

00:18:57.619 --> 00:19:00.619
I was sorry to hear about his death.

00:19:00.619 --> 00:19:02.619
Thanks, Lex.

00:19:02.619 --> 00:19:05.619
I'm doing my best to carry on his legacy.

00:19:05.619 --> 00:19:09.119
That's a beautiful locket you're wearing.

00:19:09.119 --> 00:19:14.009
Dad gave me this right before he passed away.

00:19:14.009 --> 00:19:18.470
I've worn it ever since.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:33.980
Actually, I have a gift for you.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:34.980
Child's painting?

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.980
It's your painting.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:40.980
I was going through some of my father's things, and I found it.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:41.980
You could.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.279
He gave it to me when we were kids.

00:19:44.279 --> 00:19:49.549
Well, I guess I thought I could romance you with my ABCs.

00:19:49.549 --> 00:19:52.549
It's an insignia, from when our parents would get together

00:19:52.549 --> 00:19:53.970
with the Queens and the Teagues.

00:19:57.579 --> 00:19:58.819
I don't remember that.

00:19:58.819 --> 00:20:01.759
That V was the symbol for their astronomy club.

00:20:01.759 --> 00:20:03.940
You must have seen it once and copied it.

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:07.519
They called themselves Veritas.

00:20:07.519 --> 00:20:09.660
While we were off playing, they were discussing

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:13.059
secret things behind closed doors.

00:20:13.059 --> 00:20:15.500
Do you know what they talked about?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:16.900
No idea.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.799
But considering your father's the last surviving member,

00:20:19.799 --> 00:20:26.230
he can probably explain it all to you.

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:53.220
You should tell him I say hello.

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:55.319
Where did you find this?

00:20:55.319 --> 00:20:58.359
Patricia Swan visited me today.

00:20:58.359 --> 00:21:00.380
Apparently, I made it while I was still learning my way

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:02.279
around a paintbrush.

00:21:02.279 --> 00:21:04.160
Oh, if you're looking for some validation

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.779
of your artistic talent as a child, it's a little late, isn't it?

00:21:07.779 --> 00:21:10.980
Patricia told me it's a symbol for Veritas,

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:14.480
but she's not sharing the whole story.

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:16.200
It's the misguided musings of a few years.

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:19.220
youthful idealists with a little money and too much time on their hands.

00:21:19.279 --> 00:21:22.299
We took ourselves much too seriously, I'm embarrassed to say.

00:21:22.859 --> 00:21:26.279
What secret was so important that you and your friends built a group around it?

00:21:26.279 --> 00:21:30.339
Well, think about it, Lex, skull and bones, scroll and key, the Delphic.

00:21:30.759 --> 00:21:32.380
The rich have secret societies.

00:21:32.559 --> 00:21:33.720
The others have poker nights.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:36.599
Well, it seems life dealt your charter members a poor hand.

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:39.039
Besides you, everyone else is dead.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:41.940
Why'd you kill them?

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:46.109
Give it a rest, Lex.

00:21:46.869 --> 00:21:48.609
Let the whole business rest in peace.

00:21:48.609 --> 00:21:50.769
Sorry, Dad. I can't do that.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:57.079
Lex, why don't you treat the sketch for what it is?

00:21:57.779 --> 00:21:59.660
A reminder of what you could have become.

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:07.200
If you won't tell me, I'm sure Patricia will.

00:22:20.319 --> 00:22:22.900
Yeah, he was just here. He delivered your message.

00:22:25.849 --> 00:22:28.789
I'm ready, Patricia, to make a deal.

00:22:32.839 --> 00:22:34.720
Lex likes to keep his woman on a short leash.

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:37.680
Sounds more like a choke chain if you ask me. Let's get her out of there.

00:22:42.640 --> 00:22:45.119
Okay, the passageways open up onto a steep hill.

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:46.400
It's pretty far off the road.

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:48.079
It's going to take us a lot to climb up there.

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:50.240
If it means they can clarify, I'd climb out of wrist.

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:01.619
Is she ready?

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:03.819
Yes, sir. And so is the lap.

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:05.599
Good. It's time to find some answers.

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:08.950
What happened?

00:23:10.309 --> 00:23:11.309
The feet's been cut.

00:23:11.549 --> 00:23:13.289
Lock this place down. Now!

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:18.519
What are you doing?

00:23:19.019 --> 00:23:20.420
Carrie, you have to come with us right now.

00:23:20.539 --> 00:23:22.460
We'll explain everything later. Just trust us.

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:56.599
You're not getting out, you know.

00:23:58.420 --> 00:23:59.880
I helped build this cage.

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:05.480
I've seen a lot of terrible things in your town.

00:24:07.079 --> 00:24:07.460
Look at a lot of terrible things in your town.

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:15.240
A place called Smallville be filled with such death and destruction.

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:17.240
I think it has something to do with you.

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:27.940
I was in this cage.

00:24:27.940 --> 00:24:29.940
I was head security for 33.1.

00:24:29.940 --> 00:24:32.940
I've tracked down a lot of media freaks with you.

00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:39.980
You're in a category all to yourself.

00:24:39.980 --> 00:24:48.180
The government wouldn't...

00:24:48.180 --> 00:24:51.869
What I do.

00:25:01.450 --> 00:25:02.450
Enjoy your stay.

00:25:03.450 --> 00:25:04.450
Freak.

00:25:04.450 --> 00:25:18.349
When is this place?

00:25:18.349 --> 00:25:20.349
It's freezing in here.

00:25:20.349 --> 00:25:21.349
It's Clark's Fortress.

00:25:21.349 --> 00:25:22.349
It's Fortress.

00:25:22.349 --> 00:25:25.349
We're way up in the North Pole.

00:25:25.349 --> 00:25:27.349
Right, Fortress, North Pole.

00:25:27.349 --> 00:25:29.349
And how did we get here?

00:25:29.349 --> 00:25:31.349
Through the building portal.

00:25:31.349 --> 00:25:33.349
Oh, and if there's a sudden shift in weather,

00:25:33.349 --> 00:25:36.349
just get out of here as fast as you can.

00:25:36.349 --> 00:25:38.349
Just reassuring.

00:25:38.349 --> 00:25:43.640
Jorah!

00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:53.130
Who are you talking to?

00:25:53.130 --> 00:25:55.130
Clerk's in trouble.

00:25:55.130 --> 00:25:58.130
Now I know that your brother started all of this.

00:25:58.130 --> 00:26:00.130
But right now, the only way we can help your son

00:26:00.130 --> 00:26:03.130
is if you restore Kara's memory and powers.

00:26:03.130 --> 00:26:07.259
What about?

00:26:07.259 --> 00:26:10.259
Whatever Jorel is, I don't think he's here right now.

00:26:10.259 --> 00:26:11.259
Jorrel!

00:26:11.259 --> 00:26:17.279
Across the universe, you decided to send your only son to this one.

00:26:17.279 --> 00:26:18.279
To Earth!

00:26:18.279 --> 00:26:21.279
You trusted us to protect him.

00:26:21.279 --> 00:26:24.279
Now please, Jorel, I need you to trust me.

00:26:24.279 --> 00:26:26.279
I love your son.

00:26:26.279 --> 00:26:28.279
He's in danger and he needs our help.

00:26:28.279 --> 00:27:23.759
In the fortress, we have to save Clark.

00:27:23.759 --> 00:27:57.950
Patricia?

00:27:57.950 --> 00:27:59.950
My lawyers know where I am, Lionel.

00:27:59.950 --> 00:28:01.950
If you kill me, they'll know who did it.

00:28:01.950 --> 00:28:02.950
Of course.

00:28:02.950 --> 00:28:03.950
That the evidence?

00:28:03.950 --> 00:28:06.950
My father raised me to keep my word.

00:28:06.950 --> 00:28:11.380
Before I hand this over, I need to see him first.

00:28:11.380 --> 00:28:28.009
You put him in a cage?

00:28:28.009 --> 00:28:32.009
What I have done is fulfilled my part of the agreement.

00:28:32.009 --> 00:28:38.619
And I expect you to do the same.

00:28:38.619 --> 00:28:39.619
Not yet.

00:28:39.619 --> 00:28:48.059
I want to meet him face to face.

00:28:48.059 --> 00:28:51.059
I need to verify he truly is the traveler.

00:28:51.059 --> 00:28:55.849
That can be done.

00:28:55.849 --> 00:28:57.849
I hope you've said you goodbyes, Lina.

00:28:57.849 --> 00:28:59.849
Because if he is the traveler,

00:28:59.849 --> 00:29:01.849
he's leaving with me right now.

00:29:01.849 --> 00:29:10.599
Right now.

00:29:10.599 --> 00:29:11.599
Put her on the plane.

00:29:11.599 --> 00:29:12.599
When she's on her way to Europe,

00:29:12.599 --> 00:29:14.599
return Mr. Kent discreetly to his home.

00:29:14.599 --> 00:29:18.099
I'll take it from there.

00:29:18.099 --> 00:29:23.500
That monster isn't going anywhere.

00:29:23.500 --> 00:29:24.500
What are you doing?

00:29:24.500 --> 00:29:25.500
You rich people.

00:29:25.500 --> 00:29:27.500
Your money makes you stupid.

00:29:27.500 --> 00:29:29.500
Anyone could see that thing is dangerous.

00:29:29.500 --> 00:29:31.500
It could kill somebody.

00:29:31.500 --> 00:29:33.500
For all we know, it might be a threat to national security.

00:29:33.500 --> 00:29:35.500
Pierce, listen to me.

00:29:35.500 --> 00:29:37.500
You know, in all the time that I worked for Lex,

00:29:37.500 --> 00:29:40.500
not once did he put the interests of a meteor freak

00:29:40.500 --> 00:29:42.500
above the safety of the world.

00:29:43.500 --> 00:29:45.500
He knew when to terminate a project.

00:29:45.500 --> 00:29:49.500
But you, you're not your son.

00:29:49.500 --> 00:29:52.500
And I'm gonna terminate it for you.

00:29:52.500 --> 00:30:11.299
You don't know what you're doing.

00:30:11.299 --> 00:30:13.299
Clark Kent is not a threat.

00:30:13.299 --> 00:30:16.299
You really think, after everything that I have seen,

00:30:16.299 --> 00:30:21.299
that I'm just gonna let you and the Swan Princess here just set him free.

00:30:21.299 --> 00:30:28.680
He must be terminated.

00:30:28.680 --> 00:30:30.680
He's a human being, Pierce.

00:30:30.680 --> 00:30:32.680
You'd be committing murder.

00:30:32.680 --> 00:30:39.450
It's not human.

00:30:39.450 --> 00:32:53.450
I've ever forgotten you.

00:32:53.450 --> 00:32:56.450
Somehow I never pictured the last son of Krypton making coffee.

00:32:56.450 --> 00:33:01.259
Just Clark.

00:33:01.259 --> 00:33:04.259
You know, my father thought the world of you.

00:33:04.259 --> 00:33:06.259
Dr. Swan was a great man.

00:33:06.259 --> 00:33:12.200
I have something for you.

00:33:12.200 --> 00:33:13.200
Dad's journal.

00:33:13.200 --> 00:33:16.200
Transcribed by his assistant.

00:33:16.200 --> 00:33:19.200
It's actually the last of money he kept throughout his life.

00:33:19.200 --> 00:34:02.289
I want you to have it.

00:34:02.289 --> 00:34:04.289
The traveler will bring great change to the earth.

00:34:04.289 --> 00:34:07.910
Clark?

00:34:07.910 --> 00:34:16.900
All these prophecies about the traveler.

00:34:16.900 --> 00:34:17.900
I just hope I can live up.

00:34:17.900 --> 00:34:22.460
to what everyone thinks I'm supposed to be.

00:34:22.460 --> 00:34:24.460
I've just met you.

00:34:24.460 --> 00:34:26.460
And there's no doubt in my mind

00:34:26.460 --> 00:34:28.460
that you're a force for good in this world.

00:34:28.460 --> 00:34:33.780
What if that's not enough?

00:34:33.780 --> 00:34:38.090
You're right, Clark?

00:34:38.090 --> 00:34:40.090
And there are some people out there like Lionel Luther

00:34:40.090 --> 00:34:43.090
who are willing to destroy others to get to you.

00:34:43.090 --> 00:34:48.090
Lionel had Robert and Laura Queen's plane sabotaged so it would crash.

00:34:48.090 --> 00:34:50.090
He poisoned Edward Teague.

00:34:50.090 --> 00:34:52.090
And I think he did the same thing to my father.

00:34:52.090 --> 00:34:57.699
Why would he do that?

00:34:57.699 --> 00:34:59.699
They were all part of a group who swore to protect the

00:34:59.699 --> 00:35:01.699
the traveler.

00:35:01.699 --> 00:35:04.699
Lionel wanted you all for himself.

00:35:04.699 --> 00:35:09.849
He killed all those people because of me.

00:35:09.849 --> 00:35:14.849
My father often reminded me that despite the power of the sun,

00:35:14.849 --> 00:35:18.539
it's always night on half the planet.

00:35:18.539 --> 00:35:23.539
For all the good you do, there will always be darkness.

00:35:23.539 --> 00:35:28.539
People who would kill you or abuse your power for their own gain.

00:35:28.539 --> 00:35:33.849
Lionel Luther's just one of many.

00:35:33.849 --> 00:35:34.849
Clark, I wish you would reconsider.

00:35:34.849 --> 00:35:36.849
I wish you would reconsider coming with me.

00:35:36.849 --> 00:35:40.849
As long as Lionel Luther's alive, he's a threat to you.

00:35:40.849 --> 00:35:47.940
I'll deal with Lionel.

00:35:47.940 --> 00:35:49.940
Then I'll take an apartment in Metropolis.

00:35:49.940 --> 00:35:55.949
I want to be there for you, just like my father was.

00:35:55.949 --> 00:36:02.300
Someday, I hope to see the traveler change the world.

00:36:02.300 --> 00:36:46.250
Clark, I'm sorry that you had to be locked in that cell,

00:36:46.250 --> 00:36:50.250
but it was the only way I could be sure you were safe.

00:36:50.250 --> 00:36:51.250
Safe.

00:36:51.250 --> 00:36:53.250
From what?

00:36:53.250 --> 00:36:56.250
I got these letters.

00:36:56.250 --> 00:37:01.250
You see, they threatened to, uh,

00:37:01.250 --> 00:37:04.250
kidnap you, to take you away.

00:37:04.250 --> 00:37:06.250
I didn't know who was sending them until I met with Patricia Swan,

00:37:06.250 --> 00:37:09.250
but I had no idea how many people were involved

00:37:09.250 --> 00:37:13.250
or how much they knew or what they intended to do with you.

00:37:13.250 --> 00:37:15.250
Why didn't you just tell me there was danger?

00:37:15.250 --> 00:37:17.250
Let me make my own decision.

00:37:17.250 --> 00:37:20.250
If I told you, you would have rushed out to search for your enemies.

00:37:20.250 --> 00:37:21.250
I couldn't take that chance.

00:37:21.250 --> 00:37:23.250
that you might get hurt.

00:37:23.250 --> 00:37:25.250
So instead you shoot me with kryptonite tasers.

00:37:25.250 --> 00:37:27.250
You trap me in a kryptonite cell.

00:37:27.250 --> 00:37:33.469
Why would you even build that thing?

00:37:33.469 --> 00:37:38.039
Clark, you're not the only Kryptonian who's come here.

00:37:38.039 --> 00:37:42.039
Your fellow travelers are violent, extremely violent.

00:37:42.039 --> 00:37:44.039
I built that cell for them.

00:37:44.039 --> 00:37:51.800
Then why imprison me?

00:37:51.800 --> 00:37:52.800
Clark, son.

00:37:52.800 --> 00:37:56.429
You're not my father.

00:37:56.429 --> 00:37:57.429
I spoke to Patricia.

00:37:57.429 --> 00:37:59.429
She told me about the Veritas murders.

00:37:59.429 --> 00:38:02.429
The truth can be very easily manipulated.

00:38:02.429 --> 00:38:03.429
You wouldn't know that best.

00:38:03.429 --> 00:38:05.429
You wouldn't know that better than anyone, Lionel.

00:38:05.429 --> 00:38:09.289
You've been doing it for years.

00:38:09.289 --> 00:39:01.650
I'm different now.

00:39:01.650 --> 00:39:02.650
Hey, cousin.

00:39:02.650 --> 00:39:04.650
Need me help?

00:39:04.650 --> 00:39:06.650
You've already done more than enough.

00:39:06.650 --> 00:39:11.719
I have something for you.

00:39:11.719 --> 00:39:15.719
I was saving it until you get your memory back.

00:39:15.719 --> 00:39:24.179
Thanks for saving my life.

00:39:24.179 --> 00:39:26.179
I didn't do it alone.

00:39:26.179 --> 00:39:32.619
I mean, if it wasn't for Chloe and Lana, Lex would have dissected my brain by now.

00:39:32.619 --> 00:39:34.619
I can't believe I trusted him.

00:39:34.619 --> 00:39:36.619
I'll be too hard on yourself.

00:39:36.619 --> 00:39:38.619
You're not the only one to do you.

00:39:38.619 --> 00:39:40.619
be fooled by the Luther's.

00:39:40.619 --> 00:39:42.619
Lex and I used to be best friends.

00:39:42.619 --> 00:39:44.619
I thought Lionel was my ally.

00:39:44.619 --> 00:39:47.619
But it doesn't make any sense.

00:39:47.619 --> 00:39:49.619
I mean, Lex tried to save me in Detroit.

00:39:49.619 --> 00:39:52.619
His father saved both of us in Washington.

00:39:52.619 --> 00:39:56.860
Lex and Lionel are only capable of doing the right thing

00:39:56.860 --> 00:39:57.860
if it benefits them.

00:39:57.860 --> 00:40:02.300
I want to see the good and people care.

00:40:02.300 --> 00:40:05.300
I think the Luther's are lost cause.

00:40:05.300 --> 00:40:30.679
Why have we stopped?

